# A.7 Basic C++ in CMSSW context
Complete: ![5](https://twiki.cern.ch/twiki/pub/CMS/WebPreferences/complete5.png)
[Detailed Review status](/twiki/bin//CMSPublic/WorkBookBasicCPlusPlus#ReviewStatus)
## Goals of this page:
This page explains the very basic C++ concepts in the CMSSW context. It goes through a simple analyzer class and explains
line by line the C++ elements. After reading this page, you should be able to distinguish the pure C++ features from the
adds-on provided by CMSSW framework.Note that to learn C++, reading this is not enough. Please refer to the abundant material available for this purpose: [![Search](/twiki/pub/Main/SiteDocGraphics/searchtopic.png "Search")![](/twiki/pub/TWiki/TWikiDocGraphics/external-link.gif)](http://www.google.ch/search?q=C%2B%2B+tutorial&ie=utf-8&oe=utf-8&aq=t&rls=org.mozilla:en-US:official).
## Contents
