Please for the time being use the set of tags as described [here](https://twiki.cern.ch/twiki///CMSPublic/SWGuidePATReleaseNotes41X#V08_06_01_12) on top of the recommended release to be able to follow the examples given in the followingCheckout the [FWLite![](/twiki/pub/TWiki/TWikiDocGraphics/external-link.gif)](http://cmssw.cvs.cern.ch/cgi-/cmssw.cgi/CMSSW/CMS.PhysicsTools/FWLite/) package, which contains the examples that will be discussed in the following to be able to inspect them in your favourite editor. You can use the *addpkg* command, which will automatically pick up the proper *cvs* tag from the release.
```
